#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): A long constant Wait written in microseconds (Wait 100000 us) is built inline and is exact at any size. A constant Wait in ms/10ms/s is also built inline now (see the RepeatFor_WaitMs_* files), up to 8,000,000 cycles
'Expect: compiles, and the Repeat For construct runs exactly the requested number of clock cycles (cycle-accurate simulation)

#option explicit
Repeat For 2 s
    Wait 100000 us
    nop
End Repeat
Do
Loop
